{"4442840":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Crime Podcast: Welcome to the Neighborhood","steam_appid":4442840,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4442840\/extras\/ca295f3d0ddb59d579aea9aca13e3d97.poster.avif?t=1793650506\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4442840\/extras\/ca295f3d0ddb59d579aea9aca13e3d97.webm?t=1793650506\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4442840\/extras\/ca295f3d0ddb59d579aea9aca13e3d97.mp4?t=1793650506\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crime Podcast is a psychological horror game based on real stories of people who committed evil, became victims of evil, or found themselves in difficult situations.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4442840\/extras\/374cdf65214b075a8be21469b577703d.poster.avif?t=1793650506\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4442840\/extras\/374cdf65214b075a8be21469b577703d.webm?t=1793650506\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4442840\/extras\/374cdf65214b075a8be21469b577703d.mp4?t=1793650506\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Crime Podcast: Welcome to the Neighborhood, you play as Jesse Turner, a 29-year-old employee of an insurance company who moved to a neighboring state after being assigned to a local branch. As he settles into his new place, he encounters unusual events that soon turn his life into a real nightmare.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4442840\/extras\/08d95284475dae9331fd3fee818215ac.poster.avif?t=1793650506\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4442840\/extras\/08d95284475dae9331fd3fee818215ac.webm?t=1793650506\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4442840\/extras\/08d95284475dae9331fd3fee818215ac.mp4?t=1793650506\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is primarily a first-person narrative walking simulator featuring exploration, work, and dialogue mechanics, inspired by series like Fears to Fathom and Chilla's Art.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on a real story<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival depends on the player’s actions<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric sound design<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersion through details and environment<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4442840\/extras\/ca295f3d0ddb59d579aea9aca13e3d97.poster.avif?t=1793650506\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4442840\/extras\/ca295f3d0ddb59d579aea9aca13e3d97.webm?t=1793650506\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4442840\/extras\/ca295f3d0ddb59d579aea9aca13e3d97.mp4?t=1793650506\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crime Podcast is a psychological horror game based on real stories of people who committed evil, became victims of evil, or found themselves in difficult situations.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4442840\/extras\/374cdf65214b075a8be21469b577703d.poster.avif?t=1793650506\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4442840\/extras\/374cdf65214b075a8be21469b577703d.webm?t=1793650506\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4442840\/extras\/374cdf65214b075a8be21469b577703d.mp4?t=1793650506\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Crime Podcast: Welcome to the Neighborhood, you play as Jesse Turner, a 29-year-old employee of an insurance company who moved to a neighboring state after being assigned to a local branch. As he settles into his new place, he encounters unusual events that soon turn his life into a real nightmare.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4442840\/extras\/08d95284475dae9331fd3fee818215ac.poster.avif?t=1793650506\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4442840\/extras\/08d95284475dae9331fd3fee818215ac.webm?t=1793650506\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4442840\/extras\/08d95284475dae9331fd3fee818215ac.mp4?t=1793650506\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is primarily a first-person narrative walking simulator featuring exploration, work, and dialogue mechanics, inspired by series like Fears to Fathom and Chilla's Art.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on a real story<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival depends on the player’s actions<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric sound design<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersion through details and environment<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"Jesse Turner, a 29-year-old employee of an insurance company, moves to a neighboring state after being assigned to a local branch. As he settles into his new place, he encounters unusual events that soon turn his life into a real nightmare.","supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4442840\/ef40b96fc8b12412c3ea9b506594701d6adf82eb\/header.jpg?t=1793650506","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4442840\/480197b62efe422ece2c49ef91f9413fa26c1382\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793650506","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4442840\/480197b62efe422ece2c49ef91f9413fa26c1382\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793650506","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 24 GB RAM<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10\/11<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> AMD Ryzen 7 5800X \/ Intel Core i5-1